        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-04-30T09:35:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Another one versus Plague Rat - an Infected Omni-10 with his Ablative Coating, Reactive Plating Subroutine, and both Innervation Rays. Start of turn he gets to hit himself, then Rat, then heals back up, all for free :). Similar story with an Infected Medico who has Hipocratic Oath out, though that doesn't result in any damage being dealt to Plague Rat...well, not unless Medico aims the healing at an Energy-form Scholar &gt;:).</p>",
