      {
        "id": 174383,
        "name": "The Burning Stickman",
        "username": "The_Burning_Stickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_burning_stickman/{size}/2003_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-05-01T17:58:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>A fun one I was just toying around with -- Sky-Scraper with Proportionist and Twist the Ether. Boost all her damage by 2 by changing it to Sonic, while reducing (or eliminating) any damage she sends toward her team mates (or turn it into Fire or Cold if Absolute Zero's on the team). A Tectonic Chokeslam (3 to all enemies from Proportionist, 6 to one target, then 3 to all enemies again) plus her base power (4 to all enemy targets) is enough to clear most boards and leave your team unscathed.</p>",
        "post_number": 24,
